(77, 'Eurogroup (latest release)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Eurogroup meetings are usually held in Brussels and attended by the Eurogroup President, Finance Ministers from euro area member states, the Commissioner for economic and monetary affairs, and the President of the European Central Bank. They discuss a range of financial issues, such as euro support mechanisms and government finances. The meetings are closed to the press but officials usually talk with reporters throughout the day, and a formal statement covering meeting objectives may be released after the meetings have concluded;', NULL, '2025-12-11', 'All Day', 'EUR', 'Low', 'Eurogroup Meetings', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-02 00:41:24', '2025-12-02 00:41:24'),
