(141, 'Cabinet Office (latest release)', 'Level of a composite index based on 11 economic indicators;', '\'Actual\' greater than \'Forecast\' is good for currency;', 'Released monthly, about 35 days after the month ends;', NULL, 'This index is designed to predict the direction of the economy, but it tends to have a muted impact because most of the indicators used in the calculation are released previously. There\'s a revised version of this indicator released about 20 days later, but it\'s not included for lack of significance. Source changed series from a diffusion index to a composite index as of Jun 2008 and changed series calculation formula as of Jul 2023;', NULL, '2025-12-05', '12.00', 'JPN', 'Low', 'Leading Indicators', '108.0%', '109.3%', NULL, '2025-12-02 20:28:18', '2025-12-02 20:28:18'),
