(168, 'Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond (latest release)', 'Level of a composite index based on surveyed manufacturers in Richmond;', '\'Actual\' greater than \'Forecast\' is good for currency;', 'Released monthly, on the fourth Tuesday of the current month;', NULL, 'Above 0 indicates improving conditions, below indicates worsening conditions. Tends to have a muted impact because there are earlier regional indicators related to manufacturing conditions;', NULL, '2025-12-23', '22.00', 'US', 'Medium', 'Richmond Manufacturing Index', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-02 20:41:10', '2025-12-02 20:41:10'),
