(173, 'Bank of Japan (latest release)', NULL, 'More hawkish than expected is good for currency;', '8 times per year, around 45 days after the Monetary Policy Statement is released;', NULL, 'Source changed release frequency from about 14 times per year to eight times per year as of Jan 2016;', NULL, '2025-12-24', '06.50', 'JPN', 'Low', 'Monetary Policy Meeting Minutes', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-02 20:43:35', '2025-12-02 20:43:35'),
