(246, 'ZEW (latest release)', 'Level of a diffusion index based on surveyed German institutional investors and analysts;', '\'Actual\' greater than \'Forecast\' is good for currency;', 'Released monthly, on the second or third Tuesday of the current month;', NULL, 'Above 0.0 indicates optimism, below indicates pessimism. The ZEW survey is historically focused on the German economy, and Germany tends to lead the Eurozone economy, so this overall Eurozone outlook tends to be overshadowed by the German data released at the same time;', NULL, '2025-12-16', '17.00', 'EUR', 'Low', 'ZEW Economic Sentiment', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-03 01:18:29', '2025-12-03 01:18:29'),
(247, 'Debt Management Office (latest release)', 'Average yield on a 30-year bond the government sold at auction, and the bid-to-cover ratio of the auction;', 'No consistent effect - there are both risk and growth implications;', 'Variable;', NULL, 'Auction results are reported in an \'X.XX|X.X\' format - the first number is the average interest rate of the bonds sold, and the second number is the bid-to-cover ratio (number of bids made per bid accepted). Source does not give an exact release time - this event will be listed as \'Tentative\' until the data is released;', NULL, '2025-12-16', 'Tentative', 'GBP', 'Low', '30-y Bond Auction', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-03 01:19:03', '2025-12-03 01:19:03'),
