(272, 'Eurostat (latest release)', 'Change in the price of goods and services purchased by consumers;', '\'Actual\' greater than \'Forecast\' is good for currency;', 'Released monthly, about 16 days after the month ends;', NULL, 'The \'Previous\' listed is the \'Actual\' from the CPI Flash Estimate and therefore the \'History\' data will appear unconnected. This is considered the Eurozone\'s most important inflation data because it\'s used as the central bank\'s inflation target, but it tends to have a relatively mild impact as the CPI Flash Estimate and German Prelim CPI are released about 15 days earlier;', NULL, '2025-12-17', '17.00', 'EUR', 'Low', 'Final CPI y/y', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-03 02:29:15', '2025-12-03 02:29:15'),
